{"id":5320,"date":"2025-08-30T09:11:40","date_gmt":"2025-08-30T02:11:40","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/?p=5320"},"modified":"2025-09-25T20:15:18","modified_gmt":"2025-09-25T13:15:18","slug":"cach-chay-quang-cao-shopee","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/kien-thuc-shopee\/cach-chay-quang-cao-shopee\/","title":{"rendered":"C\u00e1ch ch\u1ea1y qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o Shopee thu h\u00fat kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng chi ti\u1ebft nh\u1ea5t"},"content":{"rendered":"<div data-page-id=\"Nglodd2SdoLHnKxDAFDl1TFggqc\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HsxQdny9ko9G64xKy5MlRhYSghf\">Vi\u1ec7c \u0111\u1ea7u t\u01b0 v\u00e0o qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o gi\u00fap s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m v\u00e0 gian h\u00e0ng c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n xu\u1ea5t hi\u1ec7n \u1edf nh\u1eefng v\u1ecb tr\u00ed n\u1ed5i b\u1eadt, t\u1eeb \u0111\u00f3 t\u0103ng l\u01b0\u1ee3t truy c\u1eadp, x\u00e2y d\u1ef1ng th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u v\u00e0 b\u00f9ng n\u1ed5 doanh s\u1ed1.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Fb3udHOflotd96xJhC2l25AWgpc\">B\u00e0i vi\u1ebft n\u00e0y,<strong><a href=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\"> Lemon Digital<\/a><\/strong> s\u1ebd cung c\u1ea5p m\u1ed9t l\u1ed9 tr\u00ecnh chi ti\u1ebft, t\u1eeb vi\u1ec7c t\u00ecm hi\u1ec3u c\u00e1c lo\u1ea1i qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o c\u01a1 b\u1ea3n \u0111\u1ebfn c\u00e1ch thi\u1ebft l\u1eadp v\u00e0 t\u1ed1i \u01b0u h\u00f3a chi\u1ebfn d\u1ecbch n\u00e2ng cao, gi\u00fap c\u00e1c nh\u00e0 b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 t\u1ef1 tin l\u00e0m ch\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng c\u1ee5 m\u1ea1nh m\u1ebd n\u00e0y.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-U0Q4dJqCDon4wnx4vcGl3LO2gzb\">C\u00e1c Lo\u1ea1i Qu\u1ea3ng C\u00e1o Shopee Ph\u1ed5 Bi\u1ebfn<\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SngvddOIHo2AxyxCWZmljrJig98\">Shopee cung c\u1ea5p hai nh\u00f3m qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o ch\u00ednh, m\u1ed7i nh\u00f3m c\u00f3 m\u1ee5c ti\u00eau v\u00e0 v\u1ecb tr\u00ed hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb kh\u00e1c nhau \u0111\u1ec3 ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi t\u1eebng chi\u1ebfn l\u01b0\u1ee3c c\u1ee7a ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u00e1n.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3\">Qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o T\u00ecm ki\u1ebfm<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FWuwd0pSMoIRKAxGr4pl4zT8gkc\">Lo\u1ea1i qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o n\u00e0y nh\u1eafm \u0111\u1ebfn nh\u1eefng kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng \u0111ang c\u00f3 nhu c\u1ea7u mua s\u1eafm r\u00f5 r\u00e0ng v\u00e0 ch\u1ee7 \u0111\u1ed9ng t\u00ecm ki\u1ebfm s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m.<\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DulTdZQ8soSQgsxwQMgljvf8gCs\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o T\u00ecm ki\u1ebfm S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m:<\/strong> Khi kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng g\u00f5 m\u1ed9t t\u1eeb kh\u00f3a li\u00ean quan (v\u00ed d\u1ee5: &#8220;kem ch\u1ed1ng n\u1eafng&#8221;), s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n s\u1ebd \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c \u01b0u ti\u00ean hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb \u1edf nh\u1eefng v\u1ecb tr\u00ed \u0111\u1ea7u ti\u00ean tr\u00ean trang k\u1ebft qu\u1ea3 t\u00ecm ki\u1ebfm, gi\u00fap t\u0103ng t\u1ed1i \u0111a kh\u1ea3 n\u0103ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c nh\u00ecn th\u1ea5y v\u00e0 nh\u1ea5p v\u00e0o.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<div class=\"image-uploaded gallery old-record-id-IRZ6dT0SJoEMNmxaGFqlgRUQgwe\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;8c44164a-bae4-43fc-95ed-5cbedf1a41f3&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:628,&quot;width&quot;:1200,&quot;currHeight&quot;:628,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:628,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FNSSQbVpQ9ohg70xkXsgluvVogIf%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;NSSQbVpQ9ohg70xkXsgluv