quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FXKb0b23phoSaeexIRaylqc66gqg%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;XKb0b23phoSaeexIRaylqc66gqg&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:211552,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\">\n<figure id=\"attachment_5323\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-5323\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-5323\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/771ab3ce-aea8-4529-aaf1-74ce7139c17d.png\" alt=\"Qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o kh\u00e1m ph\u00e1 tr\u00ean Shopee\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/771ab3ce-aea8-4529-aaf1-74ce7139c17d.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/771ab3ce-aea8-4529-aaf1-74ce7139c17d-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/771ab3ce-aea8-4529-aaf1-74ce7139c17d-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/771ab3ce-aea8-4529-aaf1-74ce7139c17d-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/771ab3ce-aea8-4529-aaf1-74ce7139c17d-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-5323\" class=\"wp-caption-text\"><em>Qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o kh\u00e1m ph\u00e1 tr\u00ean Shopee<\/em><\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div data-page-id=\"Nglodd2SdoLHnKxDAFDl1TFggqc\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IXMaddIy1ob5gsxVryrlsrevgPe\">Lo\u1ea1i qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o n\u00e0y h\u01b0\u1edbng \u0111\u1ebfn vi\u1ec7c g\u1ee3i \u00fd v\u00e0 kh\u01a1i g\u1ee3i nhu c\u1ea7u mua s\u1eafm c\u1ee7a kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng khi h\u1ecd \u0111ang l\u01b0\u1edbt xem c\u00e1c s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m kh\u00e1c.<\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SZb0dDGIZojbmgx0IjJlQorkgke\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o Kh\u00e1m ph\u00e1:<\/strong> S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n s\u1ebd xu\u1ea5t hi\u1ec7n \u1edf c\u00e1c v\u1ecb tr\u00ed d\u1ec5 th\u1ea5y nh\u01b0 m\u1ee5c <strong>&#8220;G\u1ee3i \u00fd h\u00f4m nay&#8221;<\/strong> tr\u00ean trang ch\u1ee7 Shopee, m\u1ee5c <strong>&#8220;C\u00f3 th\u1ec3 b\u1ea1n c\u0169ng th\u00edch&#8221;<\/strong> tr\u00ean trang chi ti\u1ebft c\u1ee7a m\u1ed9t s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m t\u01b0\u01a1ng t\u1ef1, v\u00e0 trong gi\u1ecf h\u00e0ng.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-UQFqdB6juoKH0bxm6XElihOOg76\">H\u01b0\u1edbng D\u1eabn Ch\u1ea1y Qu\u1ea3ng C\u00e1o Shopee Chi Ti\u1ebft<\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ADhsd11lsoz7lsx0niplG1ZKgcg\">\u0110\u1ec3 b\u1eaft \u0111\u1ea7u chi\u1ebfn d\u1ecbch qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o \u0111\u1ea7u ti\u00ean, h\u00e3y th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n theo 5 b\u01b0\u1edbc c\u01a1 b\u1ea3n sau:<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-Ir3sdl9Toox4MpxSf1Dld8dzgDc\">B\u01b0\u1edbc 1: N\u1ea1p ti\u1ec1n v\u00e0o t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o<\/h3>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"image-uploaded gallery old-record-id-GUbWdc5Kwo51LvxpOyqlogdggyg\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;a90ddb26-9a6d-4166-985c-12036244d827&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:628,&quot;width&quot;:1200,&quot;currHeight&quot;:628,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:628,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FVyEbbXyLnofdFmxqjazl56aTgpc%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;VyEbbXyLnofdFmxqjazl56aTg