024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/f50a07da-0f6a-4701-bf1f-3944d45ce18a-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/f50a07da-0f6a-4701-bf1f-3944d45ce18a-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-5327\" class=\"wp-caption-text\"><em>L\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m v\u00e0 t\u1eeb kh\u00f3a tr\u00ean Shopee<\/em><\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div data-page-id=\"Nglodd2SdoLHnKxDAFDl1TFggqc\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FfyVdXTTaozZAtxlXG4lC3EVgc7\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Ch\u1ecdn s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m:<\/strong> \u01afu ti\u00ean qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o cho c\u00e1c s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m ch\u1ee7 l\u1ef1c, c\u00f3 t\u1ef7 l\u1ec7 chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ed5i t\u1ed1t, nhi\u1ec1u \u0111\u00e1nh gi\u00e1 t\u00edch c\u1ef1c v\u00e0 t\u1ed3n kho \u0111\u1ee7 l\u1edbn.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-C36kdvbFdoetlxxZ4UTlXe0zgZe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Nghi\u00ean c\u1ee9u t\u1eeb kh\u00f3a (\u0110\u1ed1i v\u1edbi Qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o T\u00ecm ki\u1ebfm):<\/strong> S\u1eed d\u1ee5ng c\u00f4ng c\u1ee5 g\u1ee3i \u00fd t\u1eeb kh\u00f3a c\u1ee7a Shopee \u0111\u1ec3 t\u00ecm c\u00e1c t\u1eeb kh\u00f3a li\u00ean quan \u0111\u1ebfn s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m. B\u1eaft \u0111\u1ea7u v\u1edbi c\u00e1c t\u1eeb kh\u00f3a c\u1ee5 th\u1ec3 (v\u00ed d\u1ee5: &#8220;kem ch\u1ed1ng n\u1eafng ki\u1ec1m d\u1ea7u Laroche Posay&#8221;) tr\u01b0\u1edbc khi m\u1edf r\u1ed9ng ra c\u00e1c t\u1eeb kh\u00f3a chung h\u01a1n.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-WpvAdQNBZo7pvFxW6Q7lY0b8gSb\">B\u01b0\u1edbc 4: Thi\u1ebft l\u1eadp gi\u00e1 th\u1ea7u v\u00e0 ng\u00e2n s\u00e1ch<\/h3>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"image-uploaded gallery old-record-id-Sq3hdGUjuoshtlxor40lZ2bigQe\