, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/73748219-98c3-4202-aaa0-13b99e480515-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/73748219-98c3-4202-aaa0-13b99e480515-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/73748219-98c3-4202-aaa0-13b99e480515-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/73748219-98c3-4202-aaa0-13b99e480515-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-5325\" class=\"wp-caption-text\"><em>Thi\u1ebft l\u1eadp gi\u00e1 th\u1ea7u v\u00e0 ng\u00e2n s\u00e1ch qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o Shopee<\/em><\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div data-page-id=\"Nglodd2SdoLHnKxDAFDl1TFggqc\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-I1Vldjmglo1MwHxiCEBlETDogDg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>\u0110\u1ea5u th\u1ea7u t\u1eeb kh\u00f3a:<\/strong> B\u1ea1n s\u1ebd \u0111\u1eb7t m\u1ed9t m\u1ee9c gi\u00e1 th\u1ea7u cho m\u1ed7i l\u01b0\u1ee3t nh\u1ea5p chu\u1ed9t (click) v\u00e0o qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o c\u1ee7a m\u00ecnh. Gi\u00e1 th\u1ea7u c\u00e0ng cao, kh\u1ea3 n\u0103ng qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb \u1edf v\u1ecb tr\u00ed t\u1ed1t c\u00e0ng l\u1edbn. Shopee s\u1ebd g\u1ee3i \u00fd m\u1ed9t m\u1ee9c gi\u00e1 th\u1ea7u tham kh\u1ea3o, b\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 b\u1eaft \u0111\u1ea7u t\u1eeb \u0111\u00f3.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-G12OddcxWoky36x2ag8lEIPVgSd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Ng\u00e2n s\u00e1ch:<\/strong> Thi\u1ebft l\u1eadp &#8220;Ng\u00e2n s\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng ng\u00e0y&#8221; ho\u1eb7c &#8220;T\u1ed5ng ng\u00e2n s\u00e1ch&#8221; cho chi\u1ebfn d\u1ecbch. Khi chi ph\u00ed qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o ch\u1ea1m \u0111\u1ebfn ng\u01b0\u1ee1ng n\u00e0y, qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o s\u1ebd t\u1ef1 \u0111\u1ed9ng d\u1eebng l\u1ea1i.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-PzWGdXYsloLGePx91WnlM3JCg8e\">B\u01b0\u1edbc 5: Theo d\u00f5i v\u00e0 t\u1ed1i \u01b0u<\/h3>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"image-uploaded gallery old-record-id-LKM6dW3Wsob9D7xbrjLlgTwSghb\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;aab33f68-6151-4267-a325-b5b9380a4ea4&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:628,&quot;width&quot;:1200,&quot;currHeight&quot;:628,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:628,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FMHzHbG1ZWoSzr5xLoBrlanl9gdf%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;MHzHbG1ZWoSzr5xLoBrlanl9gdf&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:139097,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;aab33f68-6151-4267-a325-b5b9380a4ea4&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:628,&quot;width&quot;:1200,&quot;currHeight&quot;:628,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:628,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FMHzHbG1ZWoSzr5xLoBrlanl9gdf%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;MHzHbG1ZWoSzr5xLoBrlanl9gdf&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:139097,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\">\n<figure id=\"attachment_5328\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-5328\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-5328\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/082b087a-4f78-4202-a2ff-0cd4a600a99b.png\" alt=\"Theo d\u00f5i v\u00e0 t\u1ed1i \u01b0u ng\u00e2n s\u00e1ch qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o shopee\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/082b087a-4f78-4202-a2ff-0cd4a600a99b.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/082b087a-4f78-4202-a2ff-0cd4a600a99b-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/082b087a-4f78-4202-a2ff-0cd4a600a99b-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/082b087a-4f78-4202-a2ff-0cd4a600a99b-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/082b087a-4f78-4202-a2ff-0cd4a600a99b-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-5328\" class=\"wp-caption-text\"><em>Theo d\u00f5i v\u00e0 t\u1ed1i \u01b0u ng\u00e2n s\u00e1ch qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o shopee<\/em><\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div data-page-id=\"Nglodd2SdoLHnKxDAFDl1TFggqc\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IVG2d8gDRojLDRxEXvvl7768gQh\">Sau khi thi\u1ebft l\u1eadp, c\u00f4ng vi\u1ec7c quan tr\u1ecdng nh\u1ea5t m\u1edbi b\u1eaft \u0111\u1ea7u. B\u1ea1n c\u1ea7n th\u01b0\u1eddng xuy\u00ean truy c\u1eadp v\u00e0o trang qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o \u0111\u1ec3 theo d\u00f5i hi\u1ec7u su\u1ea5t v\u00e0 th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n c\u00e1c \u0111i\u1ec1u ch\u1ec9nh c\u1ea7n thi\u1ebft.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WUtZdP2lmo3nBuxLrgCljylFg1f\">Vi\u1ec7c l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m, nghi\u00ean c\u1ee9u t\u1eeb kh\u00f3a v\u00e0 t\u1ed1i \u01b0u gi\u00e1 th\u1ea7u l\u00e0 nh\u1eefng b\u01b0\u1edbc \u0111\u00f2i h\u1ecfi chuy\u00ean m\u00f4n v\u00e0 kinh nghi\u1ec7m. \u0110\u1ec3 ti\u1ebft ki\u1ec7m th\u1eddi gian v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ea3m b\u1ea3o hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3, b\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 tham kh\u1ea3o c\u00e1c <strong><a href=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/dich-vu\/\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o Shopee chuy\u00ean nghi\u1ec7p<\/a><\/strong>. C\u00e1c chuy\u00ean gia s\u1ebd gi\u00fap b\u1ea1n ph\u00e2n t\u00edch th\u1ecb tr\u01b0\u1eddng, x\u00e2y d\u1ef1ng b\u1ed9 t\u1eeb kh\u00f3a v\u00e0 t\u1ed1i \u01b0u chi ph\u00ed qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o m\u1ed9t c\u00e1ch hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-WCZhd2MDsoDeN8xc4l8lty6fgNb\">B\u00ed Quy\u1ebft T\u1ed1i \u01afu H\u00f3a Qu\u1ea3ng C\u00e1o Shopee Hi\u1ec7u Qu\u1ea3<\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GYfLdE8EIoEyEuxDRzglAdkbgZe\">Ch\u1ea1y qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 l\u00e0 &#8220;c\u00e0i \u0111\u1eb7t r\u1ed3i qu\u00ean&#8221;. \u0110\u1ec3 \u0111\u1ed3ng ti\u1ec1n b\u1ea1n b\u1ecf ra mang l\u1ea1i l\u1ee3i nhu\u1eadn cao nh\u1ea5t (ROAS cao), h\u00e3y \u00e1p d\u1ee5ng c\u00e1c b\u00ed quy\u1ebft sau:<\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BIUtd9mB4oBToPxZVvclAJNXgeO\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>T\u1ed1i \u01b0u t\u1eeb kh\u00f3a li\u00ean t\u1ee5c:<\/strong> Th\u01b0\u1eddng xuy\u00ean ki\u1ec3m tra b\u00e1o c\u00e1o hi\u1ec7u su\u1ea5t c\u1ee7a t\u1eebng t\u1eeb kh\u00f3a. Lo\u1ea1i b\u1ecf nh\u1eefng t\u1eeb kh\u00f3a kh\u00f4ng hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 (nhi\u1ec1u l\u01b0\u1ee3t xem nh\u01b0ng kh\u00f4ng c\u00f3 l\u01b0\u1ee3t click ho\u1eb7c kh\u00f4ng ra \u0111\u01a1n). T\u0103ng gi\u00e1 th\u1ea7u cho nh\u1eefng t\u1eeb kh\u00f3a mang l\u1ea1i doanh thu t\u1ed1t.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AnshdwOBLoJKdfxp9fLlCX7Dgoh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>T\u1ed1i \u01b0u trang s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m:<\/strong> Qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o ch\u1ec9 gi\u00fap \u0111\u01b0a kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng \u0111\u1ebfn s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n, vi\u1ec7c &#8220;ch\u1ed1t \u0111\u01a1n&#8221; ph\u1ee5 thu\u1ed9c v\u00e0o trang s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m. H\u00e3y \u0111\u1ea3m b\u1ea3o s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m c\u00f3 h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh s\u1eafc n\u00e9t, ti\u00eau \u0111\u1ec1 h\u1ea5p d\u1eabn ch\u1ee9a t\u1eeb kh\u00f3a, v\u00e0 m\u00f4 t\u1ea3 chi ti\u1ebft, \u0111\u1ea7y \u0111\u1ee7.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IzLPdXKKlokqBMxdRRPl1lxGg3f\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>S\u1eed d\u1ee5ng b\u00e1o c\u00e1o \u0111\u1ec3 ra quy\u1ebft \u0111\u1ecbnh:<\/strong> H\u1ecdc c\u00e1ch \u0111\u1ecdc v\u00e0 ph\u00e2n t\u00edch c\u00e1c ch\u1ec9 s\u1ed1 trong b\u00e1o c\u00e1o qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o nh\u01b0 L\u01b0\u1ee3t xem, T\u1ef7 l\u1ec7 nh\u1ea5p (CTR), v\u00e0 T\u1ef7 l\u1ec7 chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ed5i (CR). D\u1eef li\u1ec7u n\u00e0y s\u1ebd cho b\u1ea1n bi\u1ebft ch\u00ednh x\u00e1c chi\u1ebfn d\u1ecbch \u0111ang ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng t\u1ed1t \u1edf \u0111i\u1ec3m n\u00e0o v\u00e0 y\u1ebfu \u1edf \u0111\u00e2u \u0111\u1ec3 c\u1ea3i thi\u1ec7n.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-WzeedUCGcodVRQxePMQluBBhg6g\">Chi Ph\u00ed v\u00e0 C\u00e1c L\u01b0u \u00dd Quan Tr\u1ecdng<\/h2>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WUuNdDjsgoXYxbxTkkVlRKNPgBf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>C\u00e1ch t\u00ednh ph\u00ed:<\/strong> Shopee t\u00ednh ph\u00ed qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o theo h\u00ecnh th\u1ee9c <strong>CPC (Cost Per Click)<\/strong>, ngh\u0129a l\u00e0 b\u1ea1n ch\u1ec9 tr\u1ea3 ti\u1ec1n khi c\u00f3 kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng nh\u1ea5p v\u00e0o qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CRg7dGD2JovpIfxW399l1PrWghb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>C\u00e1c l\u01b0u \u00fd quan tr\u1ecdng:<\/strong><\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet2\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DWtud4xi5o9LddxWdpsl6uGlgJn\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>B\u1eaft \u0111\u1ea7u v\u1edbi ng\u00e2n s\u00e1ch nh\u1ecf:<\/strong> \u0110\u1eebng \u0111\u1ea7u t\u01b0 m\u1ed9t s\u1ed1 ti\u1ec1n l\u1edbn ngay t\u1eeb \u0111\u1ea7u. H\u00e3y b\u1eaft \u0111\u1ea7u v\u1edbi ng\u00e2n s\u00e1ch nh\u1ecf \u0111\u1ec3 th\u1eed nghi\u1ec7m v\u00e0 h\u1ecdc h\u1ecfi.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QzsudCSvhotuYQx3jMUlblQhg9f\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Ki\u00ean nh\u1eabn:<\/strong> Qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o c\u1ea7n th\u1eddi gian \u0111\u1ec3 h\u1ec7 th\u1ed1ng h\u1ecdc v\u00e0 t\u1ed1i \u01b0u. \u0110\u1eebng v\u1ed9i v\u00e0ng t\u1eaft chi\u1ebfn d\u1ecbch n\u1ebfu ch\u01b0a th\u1ea5y k\u1ebft qu\u1ea3 sau 1-2 ng\u00e0y.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ei5yda3P1oX3Ugx6idolIf0Og9f\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Th\u1eed nghi\u1ec7m A\/B:<\/strong> H\u00e3y th\u1eed ch\u1ea1y qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o cho c\u00f9ng m\u1ed9t s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m v\u1edbi c\u00e1c h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh ho\u1eb7c ti\u00eau \u0111\u1ec1 kh\u00e1c nhau \u0111\u1ec3 xem phi\u00ean b\u1ea3n n\u00e0o mang l\u1ea1i hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 t\u1ed1t h\u01a1n.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-HtpXd9oXao75tcxwL3ulHUZJgsf\">C\u00e1c C\u00e2u H\u1ecfi Th\u01b0\u1eddng G\u1eb7p (FAQs)<\/h2>\n<ol class=\"list-number1\" start=\"1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SETDdON1woM32vxwYazlz10dggg\" data-list=\"number\">\n<div><strong>Qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o Shopee c\u00f3 hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 kh\u00f4ng?<\/strong><\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GOL9dKkrGoadJQxBLtqlnVi5gBb\">Tr\u1ea3 l\u1eddi: R\u1ea5t hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 n\u1ebfu \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n \u0111\u00fang c\u00e1ch. N\u00f3 gi\u00fap b\u1ea1n ti\u1ebfp c\u1eadn \u0111\u00fang kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng m\u1ee5c ti\u00eau v\u00e0o \u0111\u00fang th\u1eddi \u0111i\u1ec3m h\u1ecd c\u00f3 nhu c\u1ea7u, t\u1eeb \u0111\u00f3 t\u0103ng tr\u01b0\u1edfng doanh s\u1ed1 m\u1ed9t c\u00e1ch b\u1ec1n v\u1eefng.<\/div>\n<ol class=\"list-number1\" start=\"2\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BIs5d1p73onsCbxhU5als9cdgze\" data-list=\"number\">\n<div><strong>N\u00ean ch\u1ea1y qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o t\u1ef1 \u0111\u1ed9ng hay th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng?<\/strong><\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IAardVuu9ofh3jxkCE7liUCcgAe\">Tr\u1ea3 l\u1eddi: Khi m\u1edbi b\u1eaft \u0111\u1ea7u, b\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng ch\u1ebf \u0111\u1ed9 &#8220;T\u1ef1 \u0111\u1ed9ng&#8221; \u0111\u1ec3 Shopee gi\u00fap b\u1ea1n ch\u1ecdn t\u1eeb kh\u00f3a v\u00e0 \u0111\u1eb7t gi\u00e1 th\u1ea7u. Khi \u0111\u00e3 c\u00f3 kinh nghi\u1ec7m, vi\u1ec7c chuy\u1ec3n sang ch\u1ebf \u0111\u1ed9 &#8220;Th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng&#8221; s\u1ebd gi\u00fap b\u1ea1n ki\u1ec3m so\u00e1t v\u00e0 t\u1ed1i \u01b0u chi\u1ebfn d\u1ecbch t\u1ed1t h\u01a1n.<\/div>\n<ol class=\"list-number1\" start=\"3\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DHXzdQQQ9oLLVixXUeolqMb1gJd\" data-list=\"number\">\n<div><strong>Chi ph\u00ed qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o Shopee l\u00e0 bao nhi\u00eau?<\/strong><\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-B2C2da3N2oaqwgxKMt1ljcAFgSb\">Tr\u1ea3 l\u1eddi: Kh\u00f4ng c\u00f3 con s\u1ed1 c\u1ed1 \u0111\u1ecbnh. Chi ph\u00ed ph\u1ee5 thu\u1ed9c ho\u00e0n to\u00e0n v\u00e0o ng\u00e2n s\u00e1ch b\u1ea1n \u0111\u1eb7t ra, gi\u00e1 th\u1ea7u b\u1ea1n ch\u1ecdn v\u00e0 m\u1ee9c \u0111\u1ed9 c\u1ea1nh tranh c\u1ee7a ng\u00e0nh h\u00e0ng.<\/div>\n<ol class=\"list-number1\" start=\"4\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JHQ4dX6VyoFWNVxIoO4ltkChg0g\" data-list=\"number\">\n<div><strong>T\u1ea1i sao qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o c\u1ee7a t\u00f4i kh\u00f4ng hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb?<\/strong><\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RKR9d1Om6obCOYxe7cklX6ELgLd\">Tr\u1ea3 l\u1eddi: Nguy\u00ean nh\u00e2n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 do gi\u00e1 th\u1ea7u qu\u00e1 th\u1ea5p, ng\u00e2n s\u00e1ch \u0111\u00e3 h\u1ebft, t\u1eeb kh\u00f3a kh\u00f4ng c\u00f3 ai t\u00ecm ki\u1ebfm, ho\u1eb7c s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n vi ph\u1ea1m ch\u00ednh s\u00e1ch c\u1ee7a Shopee.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BZosdoYjUowpt0xVRi9lMXfegRe\">Qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o Shopee l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t kho\u1ea3n \u0111\u1ea7u t\u01b0 th\u00f4ng minh \u0111\u1ec3 th\u00fac \u0111\u1ea9y kinh doanh tr\u00ean m\u1ed9t trong nh\u1eefng s\u00e0n th\u01b0\u01a1ng m\u1ea1i \u0111i\u1ec7n t\u1eed l\u1edbn nh\u1ea5t hi\u1ec7n nay. B\u1eb1ng vi\u1ec7c n\u1eafm v\u1eefng c\u00e1c lo\u1ea1i h\u00ecnh qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o, tu\u00e2n th\u1ee7 quy tr\u00ecnh thi\u1ebft l\u1eadp v\u00e0 li\u00ean t\u1ee5c theo d\u00f5i, t\u1ed1i \u01b0u, b\u1ea1n ho\u00e0n to\u00e0n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 bi\u1ebfn c\u00f4ng c\u1ee5 n\u00e0y th\u00e0nh \u0111\u00f2n b\u1ea9y gi\u00fap gian h\u00e0ng c\u1ee7a m\u00ecnh b\u1ee9t ph\u00e1.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J76Sdgyp5o314oxSfBwldRB4gqh\">Vi\u1ec7c ch\u1ea1y qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 ch\u1ec9 l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t ph\u1ea7n trong b\u1ee9c tranh t\u1ed5ng th\u1ec3 c\u1ee7a kinh doanh online. \u0110\u1ec3 x\u00e2y d\u1ef1ng m\u1ed9t chi\u1ebfn l\u01b0\u1ee3c th\u01b0\u01a1ng m\u1ea1i \u0111i\u1ec7n t\u1eed to\u00e0n di\u1ec7n v\u00e0 b\u1ec1n v\u1eefng, c\u00e1c nh\u00e0 b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 t\u00ecm \u0111\u1ebfn s\u1ef1 h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 chuy\u00ean nghi\u1ec7p t\u1eeb c\u00e1c chuy\u00ean gia t\u1ea1i <strong><a href=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">Lemon Digital<\/a><\/strong>.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FNgEd7752omQzCxJqmdlmQTOgzf\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Gnk1dLNPqoF3ObxCdnolFtWYgkf\"><strong>C\u00d4NG TY C\u1ed4 PH\u1ea6N LEMON DIGITAL<\/strong><\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-INhkdrCPuoTF3CxFnAClt9aEg2d\"><strong>\u0110\u1ecba ch\u1ec9: <\/strong>202 Phan V\u0103n H\u00e2n, Ph\u01b0\u1eddng Gia \u0110\u1ecbnh, H\u1ed3 Ch\u00ed Minh, Vi\u1ec7t Nam<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Iqm0d89ydoNgYKxtpqXlC6FDgCb\"><strong>\u0110i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i: <\/strong>0938785735<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VwswdgZSLouEzzxkUoglk3nTgWg\"><strong>Email: <\/strong><strong><a href=\"mailto:hi@lemondigital.vn\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">hi@lemondigital.vn<\/a><\/strong><\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SOT7d26hsoedPMxhGBWlzNAdg7g\"><strong>Website: <\/strong><strong><a href=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/<\/a><\/strong><\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TUuedtJqVoReV6x5HNalSKK2gPW\"><strong>Facebook: <\/strong><strong><a href=\"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/lemondigital.vn\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">Lemon Digital<\/a><\/strong><\/div>\n<\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Vi\u1ec7c \u0111\u1ea7u t\u01b0 v\u00e0o qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o gi\u00fap s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m v\u00e0 gian h\u00e0ng c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n xu\u1ea5t hi\u1ec7n \u1edf nh\u1eefng v\u1ecb tr\u00ed n\u1ed5i b\u1eadt, t\u1eeb \u0111\u00f3 t\u0103ng l\u01b0\u1ee3t truy c\u1eadp, x\u00e2y d\u1ef1ng th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u v\u00e0 b\u00f9ng n\u1ed5 doanh s\u1ed1. B\u00e0i vi\u1ebft n\u00e0y, Lemon Digital s\u1ebd cung c\u1ea5p m\u1ed9t l\u1ed9 tr\u00ecnh chi ti\u1ebft, t\u1eeb vi\u1ec7c t\u00ecm hi\u1ec3u c\u00e1c [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":5,"featured_media":5707,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[30,1],"tags":[],"class_list":["post-5320","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-kien-thuc-shopee","category-tin-tuc"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/5320","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/5"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=5320"}],"version-history":[{"count":3,"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/5320\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":5411,"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/5320\/revisions\/5411"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/5707"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=5320"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"category","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/categories?post=5320"},{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=5320"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}